gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Hm. Today is a good day.\p"
	.string "Cold, of course - but the\n"
	.string "right kind of cold. The kind\l"
	.string "that puts a spring in your\l"
	.string "step instead of pulling it\l"
	.string "out from under ya.\p"
	.string "My name is EVERGREEN.\p"
	.string "I'm the POKéMON PROFESSOR\n"
	.string "here in BORALYSS.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This right here is what we\n"
	.string "call a 'POKéMON', but I'm sure\l"
	.string "you already knew that.\p"
	.string "This little one is a SNOVER.\p"
	.string "Tough little tree. Bitter\n"
	.string "berries hidden under all\l"
	.string "that fur.\p"
	.string "You've grown up seeing them\n"
	.string "in the windbreaks around\l"
	.string "DAWNFLAKE. Half tree, half\l"
	.string "snowfall.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "Ya know, the first thing\n"
	.string "BORALYSS teaches ya is that\l"
	.string "you don't survive the cold\l"
	.string "by yourself.\p"
	.string "Not as a person. Not as a\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Ya learn to lean on each\n"
	.string "other, or the winter knocks\l"
	.string "you down.\p"
	.string "You've known that since yall\n"
	.string "could walk - you, AUTUMN, and\l"
	.string "ASHER, running wild through\l"
	.string "these snowy pine flats.\p"
	.string "Inseparable, the three of ya.\p"
	.string "Well. Today, all that running\n"
	.string "starts going somewhere.\p"
	.string "Once yall come down to the LAB.\p"
	.string "I've got three POKéMON waiting\n"
	.string "on the table, and one of them\l"
	.string "is one of your very own.\p"
	.string "But first - I should know\n"
	.string "who I'm sending out the door.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Of course.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
	.string "I've known ya since ya were\n"
	.string "small enough to lose a mitten\l"
	.string "in the snow.\p"
	.string "And stubborn enough to dig\n"
	.string "around for it until ya found\l"
	.string "it again.\p"
	.string "And now here ya are. Old\n"
	.string "enough to step out into the\l"
	.string "cold on your own.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "All right, then.\p"
	.string "Take a breath. The day's\n"
	.string "about to get bigger than\l"
	.string "anything you've ever known.\p"
	.string "A region's worth of road\n"
	.string "ahead of ya. Eight GYMS to\l"
	.string "win. A whole POKéDEX to fill.\p"
	.string "The cold won't stop just\n"
	.string "because you do.\p"
	.string "And the road won't always\n"
	.string "be easy.\p"
	.string "But just remember that you've\n"
	.string "got a good head on your\l"
	.string "shoulders.\p"
	.string "So as long as ya use it,\n"
	.string "you'll be just fine.\p"
	.string "Now then, come see me at the\n"
	.string "LAB whenever you're ready, kid.\p"
	.string "$"
